# RamosLabs DS documentation site — build-time public config.
# Copy to `.env` for local builds, or set these in the Cloudflare build environment.
#
# Client analytics IDs (GA4 + Microsoft Clarity). These are client-side identifiers
# (public by nature) and are baked into the static HTML at build time. The design
# system's own IDs are the defaults in BaseHead.astro; override them here, or set an
# empty value to DISABLE that tracker (the loader skips malformed/empty IDs).
#
# PUBLIC_GA4_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
# PUBLIC_CLARITY_ID=xxxxxxxxxx

# Optional: override the canonical production URL used by the site + agentic layer.
# SITE_URL=https://design.ramoslabs.com
